  "details": "The user selection menu has had increasingly more functions and features added to it, with little regard of where these buttons are placed.\n\nThis causes significant friction with the menu upon change, and overall is quite daunting for users unfamiliar with the current layout.\n\nPlease could the user selection menu be reduced, to have functions combined, organised, or overall re-sorted to be more coherent and less prone to incorrect input.",
